		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Corrupted genie that appears as a shifting, human-shaped pile of sand. A single rainbow- hued eye instead of a face. Always targets most attractive foe.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +2 (1d6) and 1 evil eye or 1 sandstorm, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Evil Eye</strong>. Gaze at target within near. CHA 15+ or cursed, 1d4 HP damage (cannot heal while cursed).</p><p></p><p><strong>Sandstorm</strong>. 1/day, create blinding sandstorm 1d4 rounds, far width centered on div, all enemies CON 15+ or blinded.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
